              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p style=\"text-align:right;font-size:13px;color:#999;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;margin-bottom:24px;\">Last Updated: <strong>[DATE — e.g. 1 June 2026]</strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">1. Not Medical Advice</h2>\n<p>All content on the Burans Valley website — product descriptions, blog articles, social media — is for <strong>general information and educational purposes only</strong>. It does <strong>not</strong> constitute medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.</p>\n<p>Always consult a qualified medical professional before making dietary changes, especially if you have a medical condition, are pregnant or breastfeeding, are on medication, or are feeding infants.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">2. Product Claims</h2>\n<p>Our products are traditional food items made using the bilona method. Any statements about potential health benefits are based on traditional use and general nutritional knowledge. We do <strong>not</strong> claim our ghee can prevent, treat, cure, or mitigate any disease. Individual results may vary.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">3. FSSAI Compliance</h2>\n<p>All Burans Valley products comply with FSSAI regulations. FSSAI Licence No.: <strong>[14-DIGIT FSSAI NUMBER]</strong>.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">4. Nutritional Information</h2>\n<p>Nutritional values on labels and the website are based on standard testing and are approximate. Values may vary slightly between batches due to our natural, traditional production process.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">5. Third-Party Links</h2>\n<p>We may link to third-party websites for reference. We do not endorse or take responsibility for their content or privacy practices.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">6. Accuracy</h2>\n<p>We make every effort to ensure accuracy but cannot guarantee all content is current or error-free. We reserve the right to update information without notice.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>\n<p>Burans Valley ([YOUR LEGAL COMPANY NAME]) shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential loss arising from reliance on this website's content, to the extent permitted by Indian law.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">8. Governing Law</h2>\n<p>This Disclaimer is governed by Indian law. Disputes are subject to the courts at <strong>[YOUR CITY / STATE]</strong>.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">Questions?</h2>\n<p>Contact <strong>[EMAIL]</strong> or see our <a href=\"/grievance-redressal\" style=\"color:#1B3B2B;font-weight:500;\">Grievance Redressal page</a>.</p>\n",
